## Phase 6 — Shadow System Upgrade

**Goal:** Improve both shadow quality and shadow cost.

```text
Shadows
├── Directional
│   ├── stable cascades
│   ├── texel snapping
│   ├── cascade blending
│   └── filtered sampling
├── Spot
│   └── array allocation
├── Point
│   └── array/cubemap faces
└── Cache
    └── redraw only dirty layers
```

Player controls remain only Enabled, Quality, Distance and visible Softness where supported.

**Measured status:** with 8 point + 8 spot shadow lights, cached frames measured 16.815 ms median and one-light invalidation 16.937 ms median, only +0.121 ms above the cached floor. The current dirty-layer cache is effective; a new local-light atlas is not justified by this result.

