# Explicitly Out Of Scope For This Renderer Pass

Do not implement these as part of the roadmap above:

- Water
- Decals
- GPU particles
- Terrain
- Vegetation / wind
- gameplay VFX systems

They can consume the renderer foundation later without shaping its core architecture now.

